      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No. Why do you even do extra work just to cater to users blocking YOUR own hard work? If someone hides my avatar and I know it, they get blocked. They refuse to see my hard work, they aren't allowed to interact with me at all. Simple as that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
